window.products.push({"id":1011182,"name":"Airtight Food Storage Containers Set with Lids[8 Pack] for Kitchen & Pantry Organization, Canisters for Cereal Flour Sugar Dry Food BPA Free Plastic S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81c5uDDcPAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Help Organize Your Kitchen and Pantry - Imagine every time walking to your kitchen or pantry, found everything is neatly organized. No longer messy, you can get everything you want very quickly. With the stackable and space-saving design, these containers will make more efficient use of every inch of your kitchen pantry cabinets. 7 Size Combinations Fit Your Needs - Our kitchen storage containers set comes in 7 different sizes. Includes 2 Tall Containers (2.5qt/2.8 liters), 1 Large Container (1.6qt/1.8 liters), 3 Medium Container (1 liters/0.73 liters/0.65 liters), and 2 Small Containers (0.35 liters/0.22 liters). Our containers set will keep sugar fresh, flour silky smooth for baking needs, rice and cereal easy access whenever needed - you'll be able to find anything stored inside these bulk food storage containers Prolonged Freshness - The classic design opens the sealed container in the \"easy-open\" 5.0 era. Just flipping the lid lightly, the container can be opened quickly. What's more, the removable silicone seal makes these kitchen canisters airtight and prevents humid air from entering the container. The airtight storage containers will always keep your food dry and fresh. BPA Free and Food Grade Material - ALEEN & AJEAN pantry storage containers are made of durable plastic, BPA free, which have a longer life than many other brands plastic containers. Clear containers make it convenient to see what’s inside, you can easily get what you want without opening every container. Our Promise- We know you'll love our cereal containers storage, so if for whatever reason the product isn't working out or worth every penny of your investment-we'll give back all cash with no questions asked! You can keep these great products too","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81c5uDDcPAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALEEN & AJEAN","source_asin":"B09PTN2CS5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1011182","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PTN2CS5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PTN2CS5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1011183,"name":"Ebros Gift Large Black Panther Head Wall Decor Plaque 16\" Tall Taxidermy Art Decor Sculpture Nocturnal Predator Jaguar Wall Bust Plaque Home Decorativ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81T1jVthaUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Black Panther Head Wall Sculpture is 16\" tall, 12.5\" long and 7.75\" deep approximately. This Black Panther Head Wall Sculpture is made of designer composite resin, hand painted and polished. Color Tone may vary. Looking for an exotic wall decor to grace your room? Look no further with this high quality wall plaque!!! A black panther is the melanistic color variant of any Panthera species. Black panthers in the Americas are black jaguars. This beautiful sculpture showcases the pretty melamine black color of the giant cat and an exotic pair of yellow eyes. In the night, seeing a pair of yellow eyes reflecting the moonlight is a sign of trouble! This Panther Head hangs on one screw on the wall. It is highly recommended to anchor drywall before hanging him up.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81T1jVthaUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ebros Gift","source_asin":"B07627JMT2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1011183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07627JMT2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07627JMT2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
