window.products.push({"id":1011219,"name":"2 SPILL PROOF 20 / 10 oz Replacement Lids for Tumbler, No Leak Splash Resistant Vacuum lock Black & Teal Lids, Compatible with Yeti Lid, Old Rtic Lid,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9163YnU3C3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"➤ Spill proof 20 / 10 oz. lids – These new generation vacuum lids are Leak proof and splash proof. Help prevent messes while turning the cup on its side or accidently held upside down thanks to its locking system and airtight rubber seal. Great in keeping hot and cold liquid longer and keeping your drink insulated. ➤ Perfect match – Our replacement lids are compatible with yeti lids, old rtic lids, ozark tumbler lids and fit many other 20/10 oz. tumblers & lowball tumblers with 3 ¼ inch inside mouth diameter (not 10 oz. wine tumblers). Our lids provide tight sealing for 20 oz. yeti rambler, old rtic 20 oz tumbler and more so your favorite cup won't leak. Notice: These lids fit old rtic tumbler design with “RTIC” logo on tumbler, these lids don't fit new rtic design with “R” logo on tumbler. ➤ High quality and safe – Made with food grade crystal clear plastic that is BPA-free, easy to clean, eco-friendly, and non-toxic. Spill & splash proof design keeps hot/cold temperature of your drink longer. Prevents splashing while driving or walking; protects your drink from bugs and dirt. ➤ VALUE PACK. You get a set of 2 premium quality, durable 20 / 10 oz. closable replacement black & teal lids that are spill proof. 2 high quality long stainless steel bent standard drinking straws (0.24 inches) with rounded edges and one long cleaning brush. The lids are great fit for both straight or bent narrow drinking straws. Our pack of two for 20/10 tumbler can fit as yeti lids, old rtic lids (Only for old rtic tumbler design), ozark lids and more. ➤ Exclusive warranty ➤100% satisfaction guarantee plus 30 days money back guarantee ❤ We focus on delivering unrivaled customer service – we’re always here for you ➤ Notice: the lids fit as 20/10 oz rtic lids Only for old rtic tumbler design (“RTIC” logo) and not for rtic new design (“R” logo).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9163YnU3C3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MVP ICEBLER","source_asin":"B06XRLH55K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1011219","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XRLH55K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XRLH55K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
