window.products.push({"id":1011449,"name":"Tovala Smart Oven, 5-in-1 Air Fryer Oven Combo - Air Fry, Toast, Bake, Broil, and Reheat - Smartphone Controlled Countertop Convection and Toaster Ove","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71V-O6ILJFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"5-in-1 Air Fryer Toaster Oven Combo - Do it all with our versatile smart air fryer toaster oven combo with modes for Air Fry, Bake, Broil, Reheat, and Toast. Use scan-to-cook technology to automatically change between modes for amazing, crispy, juicy, melty textures every time. The smartest upgrade to your airfryer toaster oven, convection oven and more. Dedicated Air Fry Button - Achieve delicious all-over crispiness with a dedicated air fry button. Easily air fry using the air fry basket (included with your countertop air fryer oven) for juicy, crispy, craveable results every time. Dedicated air fry button is exclusive to the Tovala Smart Oven (5-in-1) model. Smart Control with Your Phone - Set your toaster oven air fryer combo to use one or multiple modes with the integrated app. Get notified when your meal is ready, enjoy Tovala Meals (sold separately), and browse a selection of over 1,000 scannable groceries. Chef-Perfected Recipes at Your Fingertips - With the Tovala app, access hundreds of presets and chef-perfected recipes. Follow the app's prep steps and press \"cook\" to let our convection countertop oven do the rest using air fry, steam, and other cooking modes. Scan 1,000+ Name Brands for Ultimate Convenience - Discover a wide selection of pantry essentials and frozen foods. Simply scan the barcode for the perfect cook on all your favorites. Our spacious air fryers and compact sheet pan make cooking easier than ever - no preheat required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71V-O6ILJFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tovala","source_asin":"B07KXLYMT8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1011449","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KXLYMT8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KXLYMT8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1011450,"name":"MoLi Cloth Napkins Egyptian Cotton Dinner Linen Set of 12 Pack Lunch Reusable Fabric Napkin Table Linens Servilletas de Tela Restaurant Tabel Linnen B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-PyLaaWIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Benefits of Cotton vs. Synthetic Fibers Pure cotton fabric is natural and able to withstand the test of time unlike cheaper synthetic fibers. Our napkin is 100% Egyptian Cotton, no cheap fabric or fillers added. Save Money on Paper Towels Cut your paper towel costs by a quarter by using reusable cloth linen napkins for everyday kitchen prep and casual dining. Multiple Versatile Uses Cloth napkins are easy to pack in lunch boxes for your kid’s school or to keep at your work desk. Easily create that farmhouse look by adding quality dining table linens. Or elevate your dining experience by using elegant cloth dinner napkins for Christmas, Thanksgiving, Wedding Receptions, Luncheons, Birthdays, and Fancy Celebrations. Get the feel of a fancy restaurant at home! Choose from an assortment of colors – gray, white, black, unbleached natural ivory, grey, navy royal blue, and decorative floral pattern print. Each pack contains 12 cloth napkins cotton (servilletas de tela). Quality Cotton cloth dinner napkin is not see through. Napkin weight is 150% higher than our competitors which means more absorbency and longer lasting. Low Maintenance To iron or not to iron- it’s entirely up to you! For more formal elegant dining, we recommend a quick pressing. For more casual dining, we recommend just folding the fabric napkins directly out of the dryer. Support Artisans Worldwide Our reusable napkins support the livelihood of local artisans in Egypt. Check out our handmade crochet cloth napkins set of 6 here: www.amazon.com/dp/B07D7KR2YW/","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-PyLaaWIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MoLi","source_asin":"B07584MDCQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1011450","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07584MDCQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07584MDCQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
