window.products.push({"id":1011581,"name":"GorgeousHomeLinen (R64) 1 Navy Blue Curtain Thermal Insulated Lined Foam Backing Rod Pocket Blackout Drape Panel (84\" Inch Length)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/910YeawHs2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This item is easy to hang this panel it has a rod pocket on the top for easy hanging , curtain rod is not included. Is an innovative fabric ,test shows curtain blocks out up to 90% of light , provides 100% privacy .Microfiber Soft Smooth Touch (not shiny) .Energy Efficient curtains minimize heating and cooling costs with white foam backing . it would give a complete new look to your home that everyone will compliment .This product is meant for Indoor use only .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/910YeawHs2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gorgeous Home LINEN","source_asin":"B06Y2HJGY9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1011581","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y2HJGY9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y2HJGY9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1011582,"name":"Crystal Sherry, Sweet Port and Dessert Wine Glasses | Set of 4 | 3.7 oz Small Schooner Sippers for Cordials and Liqueur | Long Stem Glassware for Drin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91hY4xcCdjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SPECIALTY VESSELS – traditionally shaped into blossoming tulips, these classic schooner sherry glasses, named after the British ships, that brought the fortified wine over from Spain, are finely tuned to maximize the enjoyment of sipping dry, naturally sweet, and sweet Jerez wines. The gently flaring bowls allow optimal surface aeration by letting the drink breathe, revealing the lush aromatic notes for the most decadent tasting experience. VERSATILE LITTLE SIPPERS – the same silhouette and small size also make these 3.7 oz 6.5” long-stemmed glasses perfect for enjoying a wide range of pre-dinner aperitifs, digestives and after-dinner drinks such as dessert and fortified wines, cordials, liqueurs, and spirits. Recommended for such classics as sweet port, Madeira, vermouth, gin, limoncello, and ice wine. Serve with savory bites, desserts, ice cream, and indulge in the delicious little moments with friends and family. TIMELESS ELEGANCE – developed with award-winning glass masters and blown from the finest crystal, these charming sherry wine glasses will add polish to any gathering. Seamless, graceful bowls feature smooth hand-polished rims, while tall twisting stems make for an effortless grip between men’s and delicate women’s fingers. SOPHISTICATED GIFT – for a birthday, housewarming, wedding, engagement, anniversary, retirement, for your boss or business partner. Every set of 4 sherry sippers comes neatly packed in our exceptional gift and storage box. The back shares a few tips for serving and tasting, while the silky glass shape matching cloth carefully secures each snifter to protect it from dust, scratches, and breaking. HANDBLOWN – all our sherry glasses are hand-blown. Due to this artisanal nature, their imperfections, or the non-uniformity, such as a few tiny bubbles, are to be considered as a characteristic of their value and authenticity, that in no way affect the quality or sturdiness of these beautiful glasses.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91hY4xcCdjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GLASSIQUE CADEAU","source_asin":"B09TRLJNYM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1011582","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TRLJNYM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TRLJNYM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
