window.products.push({"id":1011613,"name":"Crystal Allies Gallery: Choose Your Own 1.75\" Crystal Sphere Ball with Glass Stand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cMq2or4uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Since ancient times, people across different cultures have believed in the spiritual energy and protective power of stones and crystals. The sphere is a shape that truly knows no borders and it is a universal symbol found in many cultures. But what is it about spheres that have intrigued us for so long? Perhaps it is the simplicity and purity of its form: perfectly round and having no beginning or end, spheres appeal to ideas of wholeness and harmony. People have long sought the aide of spheres to find the answers and achieve such feelings of completeness. Radiating energy in all directions, spheres have thus been used for crystal gazing and self-reflection. Whether you are seeking a meditation aide or simply a beautiful addition to your home Rose Quartz's soft pink color may exude a gentle aura, but it is actually believed to be one of the most important and powerful stones. Due to its color, Rose Quartz is believed to turn the heart towards love, compassion, and harmony with oneself, others, and the universe. Rose Quartz is thus considered a powerful meditation tool for calming, cleansing, and healing. Experience the thrill of finding out how Crystal Allies Rose Quartz Sphere speaks to you. No matter what you are seeking - energy, healing, relaxation, inspiration, balance, or inner peace - you can find a powerful ally","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cMq2or4uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crystal Allies","source_asin":"B07BJ2Z4XJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1011613","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BJ2Z4XJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BJ2Z4XJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
