window.products.push({"id":1011779,"name":"AOTENG STAR Drop Front Shoe Boxes Clear 12 Pack Shoes Storage Containers Organizer Stackable,Plastic Shoe Storage Box Sneaker Cases for Closets Entryw","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tDw7Xnn-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Choose shoe box according to your needs】The size of every single shoe box is 13.1\"*9\"*5.5\" for size M (XL size is 14.2”*11”*8.3” ). The stackable shoe box suitable for the US size 5.0-10( XL size is fit for US 8.0-14). You can put in your sneakers, low-tops,sandals,etc. Make your shoes no longer messy and disorderly, thereby saving you more space and making your room look more tidy. While saving space,the clear shoe box also provides you with a lot of storage space. 【Easy-to-open transparent front door 】Completely clear door design make sure that you can quickly find the shoes you want to wear, especially when the season changes.Save a lot of time for you, no longer worry about finding shoes for the season.The simple and convenient door opening design also allows you to easily take out the shoes you want among the stacked shoes. 【Say goodbye to messy and disorderly】Use your imagination, The clear plastic box can be not only a shoe box, but also a good assistant for your daily storage. You can use the storage box to store clothes, children's toys, and even put one on the table to store cosmetics. The small body is of great use. You can put the clear shoe box anywhere: on the desk, in the corner, under the bed, in the hall, and you can also put them together and put the boxes in the living room as a coffee table. 【Stronger material】Each shoe box has a card slot at the top and bottom, so as to fix the upper and lower shoe box, that make sure the shoe box is not easy to slip off when tilted, stable and strong.The stackable shoe box is made of thicker PP material, the frame also uses a stronger ABS material and the maximum load-bearing capacity of each shoe box is up to 10KG. 【More reasonable design】There are many vents on the back of the shoe box, keep your shoes dry without falling dust. Will not mold shoes due to humid air.Every time you see it, you will have the urge to wear it like the first time.The entire shoe box contains only three parts and is very easy to assemble. The package comes with instructions, if you have any installation problems, you can also contact us directly. We will serve you wholeheartedly!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tDw7Xnn-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AOTENG STAR","source_asin":"B0BPNRTR58","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1011779","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPNRTR58","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPNRTR58","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
