window.products.push({"id":1011899,"name":"Andaz Press Personalized 11oz. Kids Milk Hot Chocolate Mug, Pink Haired Unicorn Mermaids, 1-Pack, Custom Child’s Birthday Christmas Coffee Cup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WhShCiROL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"INCLUDES: 1 coffee mugs with gift box, designed by Andaz Press SIZE: Holds 11oz of your favorite tea, coffee or beverage. MATERIAL: Ceramic, UV protected, FDA compliant. Microwave and dishwasher safe. To keep your mug looking awesome, hand washing is highly recommended. PERFECT to give your friends and family for birthdays, as a Christmas gift, or just because. GREAT for friends and family as a birthday or Christmas gift, or just because. FLAT RATE SHIPPING: Fill your cart with Andaz Press items, and pay ONE LOW SHIPPING RATE. Expedited and 2-day shipping also available! All orders ship within 1-2 business days from California.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WhShCiROL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Andaz Press","source_asin":"B07TZ4NRH5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1011899","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TZ4NRH5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TZ4NRH5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1011900,"name":"ChimneySaver Cre-Away - 16 oz. Squeeze Tubes Case Of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.21,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418nG4Su6nL._AC_.jpg","description":"Cre-Away is a four component powder that safely and effectively modifies glazed or third-degree creosote so that it can be more easily removed by chimney sweeping. First, a reactive agent neutralizes the slightly acidic creosote making it less corrosive to metal components and less flammable. Second, a dehydrator absorbs the oils and moisture contained in some forms of creosote. Third, a combustion inhibitor helps reduce the chance of chimney fires. Finally, a magnesium catalyst helps break down third degree creosote when the flue is heated by normal use. The catalyst in Cre-Away turns creosote into a char that can be more easily removed. Cre-Away works best when the flue gases are heated to about 600°F (surface stove pipe temperature about 300°F). Apply Cre-Away directly to the flue (not into the fire) using the 1 lb. applicator bottle. Cre-Away can be used to modify third-degree creosote by converting it into a more brittle state that has a different expansion/contraction rate than the flue it is attached to. During heating and cooling cycles, the treated creosote loses its adhesive properties so it can be more easily removed. Creosote and soot build-up in fireplaces or wood stove chimneys can be a fire hazard if it is not properly cleaned and maintained. All chimneys should be inspected and/or cleaned annually by a qualified chimney sweep. NOT RECOMMENDED FOR USE WITH WOOD STOVES HAVING CATALYTIC COMBUSTORS UNLESS PUT IN BYPASS MODE. If bypass mode is not available, use ACS Anti-Creo-Soot Liquid to treat creosote buildup. Apply during the heating season to modify glazed creosote, making it easier to remove. Apply Cre-Away after every cleaning to make any remaining stubborn deposits safer and to neutralize the acidity and odors from the creosote.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418nG4Su6nL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ChimneySaver","source_asin":"B006GXKV9K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1011900","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006GXKV9K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006GXKV9K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
