window.products.push({"id":1011972,"name":"Electric Tea Maker 1.5L Glass Kettle With 10 Presets One Touch Control Pancel,Keep Warm & Temperature Boil Dry Protection Water Heater, BPA free,800W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619LeAFnkXL._AC_SL1440_.jpg","description":"Veratility Boil System：The electric tea maker features 10 pre-set programs included 5 Variable temperature control. Equipped with the most accurate temp sensor.Easy to get the perfect hot water for your needs; herbal, oolong, coffee, white tea, green tea,noodles, Oatmeal,Porridge and Slow Cook. Keep Warm & Delay Time: The electric tea kettle has the keep warm function that holds your desired water temperature for up to 120min. And adjustable keep temperature from 104℉～194℉.Adjustable Delay Time from 10min～9H30min Superior Quality: Made of the finest quality borosilicate glass, which resistant to high temperatures, scratching and scuffing. The inner lid、Tea Infuser and bottom are made of high-quality 304 stainless steel. Conforms to SGS&FDA certification will keep your drink the purest and the most natural taste.All materials are 100% BPA free. Safety Design: The kettle will automatically shut off when the water reaches the set temperature. Boil dry protection shuts off the kettle if the water runs out. Easy to Clean: The wide opening and removable kettle lid allows easy water refill and simple cleaning.The kettle has a filter to keep the water/tea clean and only needs to be rinsed with hot water. The tea infuser can be washed in warm soapy water and rinsed thoroughly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619LeAFnkXL._AC_SL1440_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ICOOKPOT","source_asin":"B08DHLLPC9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1011972","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DHLLPC9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DHLLPC9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
