window.products.push({"id":1011974,"name":"Andaz Press Personalized Quinceañera Guest Book with Gold Accents, Lilac Butterflies, 120 Pages 8.5\"x8.5\" Hard Cover Custom Photo Album for Mis Quince","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zu1mv+1GL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"8.5\" X 8.5\" GUESTBOOK: This personalized Quinceañera guest book is more than just an elegant touch. Guests can sign this guestbook with touching words that can be cherished for a lifetime. With 60 lined sheets totaling 120 pages, guests can do more than just sign their names. Each page is trimmed in gold which will pair well with a classic modern, and elegant theme. It also includes 10 sheets of 24 white photo corners per sheet for polaroids, well wishes, advice, and messages for scrapbooking. HIGH-QUALITY MATERIAL: With 160 gsm paper, each of these hardcover white guest books has 60 lined sheets with a total of 120 pages with a single white ribbon. These guestbooks have 10 sheets of white photo corners totaling 240 corner stickers to use for customizing. White photo corners are included making for lasting scrapbooking memories. There are multiple uses for guest books in addition to providing for visitors to sign at your quinceanera. Use this as a party guest book, or scrapbook. PERSONALIZED GUESTBOOK: Always remember your special day with this personalized guestbook. Order a custom photo guestbook for any event from mis quince, sweet 15, 15th birthday, to Quinceaneras. Select a wide range of classic, modern, and princess themes and fonts to match. We feature several beautiful custom designs that match any quince style from butterfly to floral designs with your custom name, date, and photo so you can look back on your memories fondly. QUINCEANERA KEEPSAKE: A quinceañera guest book is a tradition that can take on many forms. From just signing guest names to leaving loving messages to the quinceanera including fun polaroid photos, a mis quince guestbook is a blank canvas for creativity. This 8.5 X 8.5 guest book may also serve as a photo album for the sweet 15 or 15th birthday with its gold trim-edged papers. Use this guestbook as a quinceanera reception sign-in book for guests. A KEEPSAKE OF MEMORIES: Create a keepsake to look back on fondly. This guestbook is a gift that will keep on giving as you reflect on your quinceañera, which marks an important milestone in a girl's life. You will always be able to look back and reflect on guests signing this book with words of well wishes and advice on your transition to womanhood. Pens are not sold with the guestbook, however, you can pair them with any type to make your guestbook as memorable as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zu1mv+1GL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Andaz Press","source_asin":"B0BT851JL2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1011974","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BT851JL2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BT851JL2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
